# Project

- Next.js App Router, TypeScript strict, pnpm, PostgreSQL 16, Drizzle, Better Auth.
- Feature folders: `src/features/<name>/{actions.ts,queries.ts,schema.ts,components/}`.
- Server actions own mutations. Queries are server-only. Zod parses every action input.
- Roles: `ADMIN`, `INVENTORY_MANAGER`, `SALES`. Check with `assertCan` / `can` on the server.
- Do not install `lucide-react`. Icons: `@phosphor-icons/react` weight `light`, navigation only.
- Charts: `@visx/*`. Import: `xlsx`. Export: `exceljs`. Jobs: `pg-boss`. Logs: `pino`.
- New modules (customers, bookings, payments, leasing) follow the same feature-folder pattern. See `docs/ARCHITECTURE.md`.
- Money is `numeric` / decimal strings. Never `number` floats for PKR or area.
- Read `graphify-out/GRAPH_REPORT.md` before large structural changes.

```ts
// action template
"use server";
export async function doThing(input: unknown) {
  const parsed = thingSchema.parse(input);
  const session = await requireSession();
  assertCan(session.user.role, "units.read");
  // ...
}
```
